ul.li:
Redact for real: blur, pixelate or cover with a box; the hidden pixels are gone
      from the saved file. Smart Redact finds email addresses, phone and card numbers,
      IBANs, IP addresses, keys and QR codes for you

Screenshots of a region or the whole screen, without GNOME's flash, straight
          to the clipboard and into the editor; after a delay counted down in the top bar;
          the editor's New takes the same kind of capture again, as chosen beside it
